# eslint-snapshot-rule-tester format: v1


Test: agentflow-no-spaced-link-stroke >> invalid >>> docs/rules/agentflow-no-spaced-link-stroke.md incorrect 1
Filename: agentflow-no-spaced-link-stroke-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | agentflow-beta TB
  2 |   A --> B
  3 |   linkStyle 0 stroke :#f00,stroke-width:4px
    |                     ^ [1]
  4 |

Output:
  1 | agentflow-beta TB
  2 |   A --> B
  3 |   linkStyle 0 stroke:#f00,stroke-width:4px
  4 |

[1] mermaid.js draws the line with this style but finds the colour of the arrowhead by `stroke:`, so the whitespace before the `:` leaves the arrowhead in the colour of the theme.
---


